IMMUTABLE FOUNDER ROYALTY
  Thirty percent (30%) of all gross revenue, transaction fees, gas tolls,
  subscription payments, API charges, and any other monetary flows generated
  by the Software or derivative works thereof shall be irrevocably allocated
  to the Founder. This royalty:
    — Is permanently encoded in blockchain consensus rules
    — Cannot be modified by governance votes, hard forks, or upgrades
    — Survives termination of this license
    — Applies to all downstream deployments and integrations

